POA&M Documentation
A formal Plan of Action and Milestones (POA&M) was created for the ICMP Timestamp Request Remote Date Disclosure finding consistent with DoD RMF documentation requirements.
POA&M Summary:

Finding: ICMP Timestamp Request Remote Date Disclosure
Severity: Low (CVSS 2.1)
Status: Open — Accepted Risk
Documentation: Full POA&M artifact available in the POAMs folder of this repository

The POA&M documents the risk decision, planned mitigation actions, responsible party, and scheduled completion date consistent with continuous monitoring requirements under NIST SP 800-53 and DoD RMF guidelines.

